-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bask","sort_order":1,"sense":"曬太陽","alt_zh":"高中生與成年自然老師遠距觀察乾淨池邊烏龜曬太陽。","example":"The turtles began to bask on a warm rock.","example_zh":"烏龜開始在溫暖石頭上曬太陽。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bask-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-beckon-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"beckon","sort_order":1,"sense":"招手","alt_zh":"成年館員在安全展臺旁微笑招手，高中生走近聆聽。","example":"The guide used a friendly gesture to beckon the visitors closer.","example_zh":"導覽員友善招手，請訪客靠近。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/beckon-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-befriend-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"befriend","sort_order":1,"sense":"交友","alt_zh":"高中生在成年老師旁友善邀轉學生一起坐下閱讀。","example":"The students decided to befriend the newcomer.","example_zh":"學生決定與新來同學交朋友。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/befriend-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-beguile-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"beguile","sort_order":1,"sense":"迷惑；吸引","alt_zh":"成年說書人在圖書館生動講故事，高中觀眾專注微笑。","example":"The storyteller could beguile the audience with her vivid descriptions.","example_zh":"說書人能用生動描述迷住聽眾。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/beguile-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-behold-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"behold","sort_order":1,"sense":"注視","alt_zh":"成年嚮導與高中生在有護欄觀景臺安靜欣賞晨光瀑布。","example":"We stopped to behold the waterfall in the morning light.","example_zh":"我們停下來注視晨光中的瀑布。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/behold-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior