-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-boisterous-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"boisterous","sort_order":1,"sense":"喧鬧的","alt_zh":"高中生與成年觀眾在校園音樂會後興奮鼓掌，安全有序。","example":"The boisterous fans cheered after the final song.","example_zh":"喧鬧樂迷在最後一首歌後歡呼。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/boisterous-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-brazen-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"brazen","sort_order":1,"sense":"厚顏的","alt_zh":"戲劇工作坊中成年演員演出插隊，工作人員平靜請他回隊尾，無辱罵。","example":"The character's brazen attempt to skip the queue upset the others.","example_zh":"角色厚顏插隊的行為惹其他人不悅。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/brazen-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bristle-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bristle","sort_order":1,"sense":"發怒","alt_zh":"成年虛構角色皺眉聽錯誤指控，調解員平靜邀雙方核對文件。","example":"He began to bristle at the unfair accusation.","example_zh":"他因不公平指控開始發怒。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bristle-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bungle-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bungle","sort_order":1,"sense":"搞砸","alt_zh":"高中喜劇排練中成年角色困惑看散開的安全模型時鐘，導演溫和指導。","example":"The character managed to bungle the simple repair.","example_zh":"那個角色竟把簡單修理搞砸。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bungle-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-buoyancy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"buoyancy","sort_order":1,"sense":"浮力","alt_zh":"成年老師監督高中生在低水位透明水槽比較兩艘模型船承載小砝碼。","example":"The experiment compared the buoyancy of two small boats.","example_zh":"實驗比較兩艘小船的浮力。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supaba